+            # clipping Print to "Pri", not a scroll/clip-property bug.
+            # expand_last only ever made sense for >=2 columns (spreading a
+            # leftover odd item across the remaining width); in a grid
+            # that's deliberately 1 column already, colspan=2 is never
+            # valid and always overflows. False restores Print to the same
+            # 79px width as its siblings.
+            self.labels["menu"] = self.arrangeMenuItems(items, 1, False)
+            # Single-line labels for these 5 buttons only (2026-07-30,
+            # final part of the Print-button fix): the shared Button()/
+            # format_label() default (lines=2, WORD_CHAR wrap) is fine for
